tle=\"57-df-mod\">57-df-mod</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"16a587bb999452b8\" href=\"?note=16a587bb999452b8\" title=\"57-df-var-in-term\">57-df-var-in-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9f84d5a885cb119f\" href=\"?note=9f84d5a885cb119f\" title=\"57-df-universal-closure\">57-df-universal-closure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为纯函数语言（允许常量，无关系符号）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 为一组普遍闭包的等式句子：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\{\\operatorname{All}(\\vec x,s\\doteq t):s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S,\\ \\vec x\\text{ 为覆盖 }\\mathrm{var}(s)\\cup\\mathrm{var}(t)\\text{ 的互异有限变量列}\\}\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\{\\operatorname{All}(\\vec x,s\\doteq t):s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S,\\ \\vec x\\text{ 为覆盖 }\\mathrm{var}(s)\\cup\\mathrm{var}(t)\\text{ 的互异有限变量列}\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{All}\">\\(\\operatorname{All}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"9f84d5a885cb119f\" href=\"?note=9f84d5a885cb119f\" title=\"57-df-universal-closure\">57-df-universal-closure</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=\\mathrm{Mod}(\\Phi)\">\\(K=\\mathrm{Mod}(\\Phi)\\)</span>；假定存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A_0\\in K\">\\(\\mathfrak A_0\\in K\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigl||\\mathfrak A_0|\\bigr|\\ge2\">\\(\\bigl||\\mathfrak A_0|\\bigr|\\ge2\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为集合，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\ne\\emptyset\">\\(X\\ne\\emptyset\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Const}_S\\ne\\emptyset\">\\(\\mathrm{Const}_S\\ne\\emptyset\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeObj}\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeObj}\\)</span> 保留 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"be9e6bea58d776c6\" href=\"?note=be9e6bea58d776c6\" title=\"57-df-free-model\">57-df-free-model</a> 的生成集字面包含约定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathfrak F\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\quad\\mathrm{FreeObj}(K,X,\\mathfrak F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\mathfrak F\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\quad\\mathrm{FreeObj}(K,X,\\mathfrak F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>任意一阶公式类未必有自由对象；等式类、非平凡性和非空项代数条件在这里明确给出。结论是自由对象存在，不是原 Free(K,X) 所要求的结构对象字面唯一。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-free-model","status":"resolved","id":"be9e6bea58d776c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-free-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-mod","status":"resolved